        Business Lens

Defining the Bussines Viewpoint:
        From a bussines perspective evolution of e-commerce of companies like Amazon ad eBay shows how technologies has changed original retail into a global digital marketplace.


Companies Model Revolution:
        The evolution of e-commerce showed new ways for increasing the income.However Amazon and eBay developed online places that allowed them to gain income from many different sources.

        Amazon:There income is based on selling online products,advertising and having a subscription called Amazon Prime.
        eBays:It mainly earns money from services that are based on their online website.

        Bussines Growth:Both of the companies decided to create opportunities for small businesses to reach customers from different countries having no need to open physical stores.


Market Position Changes:
        Amazons Customers Loyalty:They make customers continue shopping when having an active subscription that provide fast delivery and a lot of different benefits.
        eBays Market Expansion:eBay started from online store that was used only in a few countries then advanced into global marketplace where people can sell products directly to the custoemr.
        Accessibility:Both companies provide a delivery that can access people from all over the world.
        Competetive Advantages:Amazon focuses more on fast delivery,lowest prices then other companies and customers comfort while shopping.However eBay provides a marketplace for new and second hand products so people can buy whatever they want.


Service Benefits:

Computing developments also improved how e-commerce companies manage their routine services for example:
        Digitalization:Nowadays all of the things are mostly being managed online like ordering products,payments and automated stock management this reduces the amount of manual work employees have to do.

        Delivery:Amazon invested everything into making the company more modern and having a really fast delivery.

        Data Analysis:Both companies use customers data to understand often purchases so they can recomend products and improve their services.

However all of these developments caused companies to advance all of theirs security for the customers accounts,delivery networks and customers support.This also saved a lot of money for the companies because they are more digital based and wont have to worry about opening new physical stores.

Bussiness Perfomace:

        Amazons Growth:Amazons net sales of 201 billion showing 12% of increase compared with the same period of time in 2025.This the continued growth of its online retail and online businesses.In addition to this Amazons operating earning are around 28 billion.This also shows how improvements in techonologys delivery and business management can increase profitability.

        eBays Growth:eBay gained around 3.2 bilion in revenues in 2026, making it a 14% more compared with previous year.Moreover eBay made around 147 million euros from active buyers and 23 billion in Gross Merchandise Volume (GMV).Its GMV increased by 15% compared with the same period of time in previous year.This shows the financial improvements and marketplace growth.

Connection to Module Concepts:
        To Conclude the evolution of Amazon and eBay shows how digitalization can solve many problems while creating new ways of increasing the income.Both companies improved from relying on physical stores to having everything online from security of each customers account to using data analytics of customers to manage and recomend how products to the customer and supporting billions of customers.It also shows how technology creates new business opportunities for example small businesses can use Amazon or eBay to reach customers from different countries.At the same time customers have a big amount of products to chose from and price is average comared to other companies and comfortable shopping assistance.



        

